window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>After eight years in a cave, I was finally rescued… by a terrifying fae king who tells me I'm his mate.</b><br> <br> He's rough, growly, and refuses to answer any of my questions as he takes me back to the fae lands.<br> <br> When we get there, I learn that a large faction of his people want him dead, so they paid in blood and magic for an ancient assassin to hunt him down.<br> <br> Our mate bond should hide him from the monster, but if his people find out about it, we'll be executed.<br> <br> And the bond itself?<br> <br> It's a mental and physical connection that creates attraction between us—insanely strong attraction that we both struggle to resist.<br> <br> We're fighting for our lives…yet somehow my mind keeps returning to the tie that binds our souls.</p> <p><b><i>*This is a steamy enemies to lovers Rapunzel retelling with Beauty and the Beast and Hades and Persephone vibes. Each book in this fantasy romance trilogy follows a different couple with their own happily ever after, and the stories can be listened to in any order.</i></b></p>"; 
